      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "From @Y.Dan.Rubinstein@gmail.com <Y.Dan.Rubinstein@gmail.com>’s latest planning message; priorities below remain open unless confirmed.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00037",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[37]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3921,
      "endIndex": 4125,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Budget — In process with @caitlee@stanford.edu <caitlee@stanford.edu>. Confirm available funds for the year and quarter, then agree allocations for Bachata and Zouk instructors alongside other club costs. No budget or spending approval confirmed.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00038",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[38]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4125,
      "endIndex": 4353,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Rooms and schedule — Confirm quarter-long room bookings and finalized weekly class/social times for both dances. Booking owner and completion status remain to agree; existing event details do not establish quarter reservations.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00039",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[39]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4353,
      "endIndex": 4703,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Instructor outreach — First agree who owns outreach. Identify strong South Bay instructors; suggested candidates include Nelly Caldeira, Alexia & Zohra, and others. Request availability and actual quotes once outreach is authorized. The advisor’s estimate of about $150/hour/instructor is a planning estimate, not a verified quote or approved spend.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00040",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[40]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4703,
      "endIndex": 4948,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Quarter announcement — After budget, rooms, instructors and times are confirmed, announce class locations, costs, instructors and schedule. Advertising ownership stays within the existing agreed scope; no new channel ownership is assigned here.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00041",
